414
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:46,660
OK? Aqui vou eu.

415
00:27:46,740 --> 00:27:49,450
Concentre-se em mim. Respirar.

416
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:52,370
Assim.

417
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:56,410
