474
00:32:50,120 --> 00:32:51,290
Isso é bom, Marie-Pierre?

475
00:32:51,370 --> 00:32:52,330
Sim.

476
00:32:52,740 --> 00:32:54,370
Colocamos todo o resto de volta também.

477
00:32:54,870 --> 00:32:56,200
Volto logo.

478
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:59,870
