481
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:06,830
Devo guardar a mala esta semana?

482
00:33:06,910 --> 00:33:07,870
Sim.

483
00:33:08,330 --> 00:33:09,290
OK.

484
00:33:11,040 --> 00:33:12,080
